---
description: >-
  Label syntax (#1368): items and transition labels written as plain markdown, a quoted
  markdown string (with double and with single quotes), a code span, tags and a written \n;
  only the markdown strings are bold and italic. The title is a quoted markdown string. Items
  and transition labels are always quoted, so they have no bare form.
config:
  cynefin:
    seed: 7
---
cynefin-beta
  title "`title **bold** _ital_`"
  complex
    "item **bold** _ital_"
    "`item **bold** _ital_`"
  complicated
    "item a `code` b"
    '`item single **bold**`'
  chaotic
    "item <b>bold</b> <i>ital</i><br>next H<sub>2</sub>O"
  clear
    "item one\ntwo"
  complex --> complicated : "transition **bold** _ital_"
  complicated --> clear : "`transition **bold** _ital_`"
  clear --> chaotic : "transition a `code` b"
  chaotic --> complex : "transition <b>bold</b> <i>ital</i><br>next H<sub>2</sub>O"
  complex --> clear : "transition one\ntwo"
